WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.256 --> 00:00:02.408
- I do think that people are psychic.

00:00:02.408 --> 00:00:04.165
Do I think all the psychics that you see

00:00:04.165 --> 00:00:06.297
on the block are actually psychic? No.

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:08.545
I definitely think there are a select few

00:00:08.545 --> 00:00:09.597
that have the ability.

00:00:09.597 --> 00:00:12.180
(spooky music)

00:00:17.807 --> 00:00:19.779
- Never heard of Zener cards in my life.

00:00:19.779 --> 00:00:21.820
- No, I have not heard of Zener cards.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.786
- I don't know that I realized
they were called that,

00:00:23.786 --> 00:00:27.143
but I recognize from
the movie Ghostbusters.

00:00:27.143 --> 00:00:28.690
- Square.

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:29.553
- Good guess.

00:00:29.553 --> 00:00:30.386
But wrong.

00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:33.188
(electrical zapping)

00:00:33.188 --> 00:00:35.303
- So, I guess the whole way this works is

00:00:35.303 --> 00:00:37.718
we're guessing which shape.

00:00:37.718 --> 00:00:39.214
- Whoever gets the most right,

00:00:39.214 --> 00:00:40.628
the winner is going to be shot--

00:00:40.628 --> 00:00:43.045
shooting the loser with this.

00:00:44.015 --> 00:00:45.506
- It's like Ripley's gun.

00:00:45.506 --> 00:00:49.441
- Okay, so it's either river, plus signs,

00:00:49.441 --> 00:00:50.910
star, square, or circle.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.565
I gotta figure out which one.

00:00:52.565 --> 00:00:55.265
(electrical buzzing)

00:00:55.265 --> 00:00:56.098
Star.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.218
- Oh, Jordan's psychic!

00:00:59.218 --> 00:01:00.801
- It's a plus sign.

00:01:01.717 --> 00:01:03.790
- Hmm, squiggly lines.

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:05.195
- It was a circle.
- Aww...

00:01:05.195 --> 00:01:06.766
It's sort of squiggly lines.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:07.599
- Circle.

00:01:09.297 --> 00:01:10.130
Bitch!

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.320
- Plus?

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:12.487
- It's a star.

00:01:12.487 --> 00:01:13.442
- Square.

00:01:13.442 --> 00:01:14.441
- Squiggly lines.

00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:16.548
I was actually guessing the next card.

00:01:16.548 --> 00:01:17.465
- Triangle.

00:01:18.753 --> 00:01:19.586
Damn.

00:01:19.586 --> 00:01:20.419
Triangle? There is no triangle!

00:01:20.419 --> 00:01:21.319
- Oh, (beep).

00:01:21.319 --> 00:01:24.340
- Concentrating really hard.

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:25.340
It's a star.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:27.673
No!

00:01:27.673 --> 00:01:28.506
- Star.

00:01:29.526 --> 00:01:30.906
Please be a star.

00:01:30.906 --> 00:01:31.739
Oh.

00:01:31.739 --> 00:01:32.917
- She got it right.

00:01:32.917 --> 00:01:34.209
- I got it, I just tap into my mind.

00:01:34.209 --> 00:01:35.855
I've gotta believe in myself.

00:01:35.855 --> 00:01:38.128
And I've gotta feel the
power coming through me.

00:01:38.128 --> 00:01:39.711
- I believe in you.

00:01:43.026 --> 00:01:44.073
- Star.

00:01:44.073 --> 00:01:44.906
- No...

00:01:44.906 --> 00:01:45.739
- Mother---

00:01:45.739 --> 00:01:47.704
You know what? Screw this game, screw it.

00:01:47.704 --> 00:01:48.537
- Circle?

00:01:49.435 --> 00:01:50.637
- She got it right.

00:01:50.637 --> 00:01:51.470
- Square.

00:01:52.807 --> 00:01:53.866
- Squiggly lines again.

00:01:53.866 --> 00:01:54.699
- Again?

00:01:57.042 --> 00:01:59.513
- I don't know, I definitely feel like

00:01:59.513 --> 00:02:01.719
I would not be able to be responsible

00:02:01.719 --> 00:02:03.324
with any sort of psychic ability.

00:02:03.324 --> 00:02:05.932
I feel like I would just be
abusing that all the time.

00:02:05.932 --> 00:02:07.675
- I've always wanted to do this.

00:02:07.675 --> 00:02:11.000
I was so sure I would totally
nail it if I ever did it.

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:14.377
I'm never gonna do it
again so I can always say,

00:02:14.377 --> 00:02:15.210
- She was right.

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:17.059
- "Well, I was right
two out of three times."

00:02:17.059 --> 00:02:18.541
- I thought that people could possess

00:02:18.541 --> 00:02:20.996
like cool superpowers, psychic abilities.

00:02:20.996 --> 00:02:23.789
I thought I could gain my
abilities on my 18th birthday.

00:02:23.789 --> 00:02:25.850
And then that didn't happen so after that

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:27.559
things went downhill from there.

00:02:27.559 --> 00:02:28.571
(laughs)

00:02:28.571 --> 00:02:30.826
- Well it looks like I'm
getting shot with a Nerf gun.

00:02:30.826 --> 00:02:32.679
- I'm so sorry.

00:02:32.679 --> 00:02:35.252
- Um, I'll try to be good to you.

00:02:35.252 --> 00:02:36.843
- [Daraius] Oh my God.
(laughs)

00:02:36.843 --> 00:02:38.424
(Nerf gun revs up)

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:39.889
- [Jordan] Selorm, I'm sorry.

00:02:39.889 --> 00:02:40.952
(Nerf gun firing repeatedly)

00:02:40.952 --> 00:02:41.935
- (beep) shit!

00:02:41.935 --> 00:02:42.828
No! Ouch, ow!

00:02:42.828 --> 00:02:44.353
Okay, that's enough!

00:02:44.353 --> 00:02:45.353
He said one!

00:02:46.712 --> 00:02:47.545
- [Daysha] Oh my God!

00:02:47.545 --> 00:02:48.378
- She missed!

00:02:48.378 --> 00:02:50.631
(laughs)

00:02:50.631 --> 00:02:53.835
- [Daysha] This is terrifying.

00:02:53.835 --> 00:02:56.258
(screams)

00:02:56.258 --> 00:02:58.687
(laughs)

00:02:58.687 --> 00:03:01.332
- Okay, I can't do that anymore.

00:03:01.332 --> 00:03:02.415
I'm so sorry.

